WEBVTT

00:00:14.725 --> 00:00:15.934
HARRY:
Griphook!

00:00:15.976 --> 00:00:17.770
GRIPHOOK: Thieves! Help!
-Griphook!

00:00:17.811 --> 00:00:19.646
Thieves!

00:00:20.647 --> 00:00:22.274
[BOGROD CHUCKLES]

00:00:22.316 --> 00:00:25.277
Foul little git.
Least we've still got Bogrod.

00:00:32.493 --> 00:00:33.160
That's unfortunate.

00:00:38.165 --> 00:00:40.459
HERMIONE: We can't just stand here.
Who's got an idea?

00:00:40.501 --> 00:00:42.169
You're the brilliant one.

00:00:42.211 --> 00:00:44.630
I've got something, but it's mad.

00:00:44.671 --> 00:00:46.006
Reducto.

00:00:58.894 --> 00:01:00.020
Well, come on, then.

00:01:02.689 --> 00:01:04.733
Relashio.

00:01:32.052 --> 00:01:33.929
[RUMBLING FAINTLY]

00:01:43.564 --> 00:01:44.731
[ALL YELLING]

00:01:51.405 --> 00:01:53.323
GOBLIN:
He's moving! Aah!

00:02:15.262 --> 00:02:17.598
[PANTING]

00:02:19.933 --> 00:02:21.226
RON:
Now what?

00:02:21.268 --> 00:02:22.603
Reducto.

00:02:23.812 --> 00:02:25.230
Hold on.

00:02:34.781 --> 00:02:38.660
RON:
That was brilliant. Absolutely brilliant.

00:03:05.979 --> 00:03:06.647
HARRY:
We're dropping.

00:03:10.734 --> 00:03:13.111
RON: I say we jump.
-When?

00:03:13.153 --> 00:03:14.529
Now.

00:03:36.301 --> 00:03:37.344
[YELLS]

00:03:42.307 --> 00:03:43.558
[GASPING]

00:04:04.997 --> 00:04:06.665
[ALL PANTING]

00:04:08.959 --> 00:04:12.045
He knows. You-Know-Who.

00:04:12.087 --> 00:04:13.839
He knows we broke into Gringotts.

00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:17.175
He knows what we took
and he knows we're hunting Horcruxes.

00:04:17.217 --> 00:04:19.177
-How is it you know?
-I saw him.

00:04:19.219 --> 00:04:21.805
HERMIONE:
You let him in? Harry, you can't do that.

00:04:21.847 --> 00:04:25.517
Hermione, I can't always help it.
Well, maybe I can. I don't know.

00:04:25.559 --> 00:04:27.394
RON:
Never mind. What happened?

00:04:27.436 --> 00:04:29.354
Well, he's angry.

00:04:29.396 --> 00:04:31.106
And scared too.

00:04:31.148 --> 00:04:34.776
He knows if we find and destroy all
the Horcruxes we'll be able to kill him.

00:04:34.818 --> 00:04:38.488
I reckon he'll stop at nothing
to make sure we don't find the rest.

00:04:39.698 --> 00:04:42.075
There's more. One of them's at Hogwarts.

00:04:42.117 --> 00:04:43.952
HERMIONE:
What?

00:04:43.994 --> 00:04:46.788
-You saw it?
-I saw the castle and Rowena Ravenclaw.

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:49.541
It must have to do with her.
We have to go there now.

00:04:49.583 --> 00:04:53.003
We can't do that. We've got to plan.
We've got to figure it out.

00:04:53.045 --> 00:04:56.298
Hermione, when have any of our plans
ever actually worked?

00:04:56.339 --> 00:04:58.759
We plan, we get there,
all hell breaks loose.

00:04:59.885 --> 00:05:01.261
He's right.

00:05:01.303 --> 00:05:05.682
One problem: Snape's headmaster now.
We can't just walk through the front door.

00:05:05.724 --> 00:05:10.604
Um, well, we'll go to Hogsmeade,
to Honeydukes.

00:05:10.645 --> 00:05:13.106
Take the secret passage in the cellar.

00:05:13.148 --> 00:05:16.651
It's-- There's something wrong with him.

00:05:16.693 --> 00:05:21.156
It's like, you know, in the past, I've always
been able to follow his thoughts.

00:05:21.198 --> 00:05:24.201
And now everything
just feels disconnected.

00:05:24.242 --> 00:05:25.660
Maybe it's the Horcruxes.

00:05:25.702 --> 00:05:27.829
Maybe he's growing weaker.
Maybe he's dying.

00:05:27.871 --> 00:05:31.124
No. No, it's more like he's wounded.

00:05:31.166 --> 00:05:33.960
If anything, he feels more dangerous.

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:40.842
VOLDEMORT [IN PARSELTONGUE]:
The boy has discovered our secret, Nagini

00:05:43.303 --> 00:05:45.347
It makes us vulnerable

00:05:46.181 --> 00:05:48.892
We must deploy all our forces now
to find him

00:05:50.560 --> 00:05:55.732
And you, my friend, must stay close

00:05:58.318 --> 00:05:59.319
[NAGINI HISSES]

